Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package ships with no third-party runtime dependencies. The
published tarball contains only:

    - package.json
    - README.md
    - LICENSE                 (Apache License, Version 2.0)
    - NOTICE                  (this file)
    - dist/                   (TypeScript compiled output authored by Autonomi)

Build-time dependencies (`tsup`, `typescript`, `vitest`) are not
included in the published tarball.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Specifications referenced
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package implements the agents.txt v0.2 specification, published in
the public facet-llc/spec repository under Apache-2.0. It also
references the IETF JWT (RFC 7519)
and JSON Web Key (RFC 7517) specifications under the IETF Trust
Provisions.

